OL,3,GNEWSA'It's our highlight of the year' -
OL,4,Athe vloggers who watch Goose Fair
OL,5,Aarrive
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe bollards are removed from the
OL,8,Fentrance of Nottingham's Forest
OL,9,FRecreation Ground as a convoy of huge
OL,10,Florries arrive and a flock of
OL,11,Fenthusiasts ready their cameras to
OL,12,Fcapture the "magic" and the mechanics
OL,13,Fbehind the Goose Fair.
OL,15,F"It's just the craziest pull-on of any
OL,16,Ffair but it's also the best one to
OL,17,Fwatch - just to see the madness.
OL,19,F"It's our highlight of the year," said
OL,20,FGraham Ciborski.
