OL,3,GNEWSA'It's our highlight of the year' -
OL,4,Athe vloggers who watch Goose Fair
OL,5,Aarrive
OL,6,
OL,7,FBefore any other visitors arrive, he
OL,8,Fjoins a group of other fairground
OL,9,Fenthusiasts who have travelled from
OL,10,Facross the country to watch the pull-on
OL,11,F- the arrival of the rides, equipment
OL,12,Fand trailers - and build-up to the
OL,13,Fevent.
